<title>NEW ZEALAND: Michael Hill lifts first half net profit.</title>
<headline>Michael Hill lifts first half net profit.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year result to Dec 31</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    4.37 vs 4.13</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   11.3 vs 10.7</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    3.5 vs 3.0</p>
<p>    Turnover			     65.84 vs 59.99</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 6.74 vs 6.37</p>
<p>    Tax				     2.38 vs 2.24</p>
<p>Dividend carries 1.724 cps imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date March 17</p>
<p>Reg date March 7</p>
<p>Ex div   March 10</p>
<p>Note - Michael Hill International Ltd operates jewellery chains in New Zealand and Australia.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
